# Documentation corpus

Applies when editing docs, scripts, or `.agentic/` configuration.

## Lifecycle

- Every doc under `docs/` carries front matter per @docs/spec/DOCUMENT_LIFECYCLE.md
- Only `approved` and `accepted` artifacts carry authority (@docs/spec/AUTHORITY_MODEL.md)
- Gate IDs, hook points, and state tokens come from `.agentic/registries/` only (@docs/spec/REGISTRIES.md)
- Regenerate @docs/DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md with `python3 scripts/build_index.py` when adding documents

## Validation

```bash
pip install -r requirements-docs.txt
python3 scripts/build_index.py
python3 scripts/validate_docs.py
python3 scripts/test_validate_docs.py   # when scripts/ changes
python3 scripts/check_gates.py --strict --base origin/main
```

## Gates

`platform_config` triggers on `.agentic/project.yaml`, `.agentic/registries/**`, `.agentic/hooks/**`, and `.agentic/roles/*.yaml`. Crossing it needs an approval record.
